{"text":"Now, I know many people in this room and around the world will think, well, actually, this is hard to grasp, because private capitalism and liberal democracy are held sacrosanct. But I ask you today, what would you do if you had to choose? What if you had to choose between a roof over your head and the right to vote? Over the last 10 years, I've had the privilege to travel to over 60 countries, many of them in the emerging markets, Latin America, Asia, and my own continent of Africa. I've met with presidents, dissidents, policymakers, lawyers, teachers, doctors, and the man on the street. And through these conversations, it's become clear to me that many people in the emerging markets believe that there's actually a split occurring between what people believe ideologically in terms of politics and economics in the West and that which people believe in the rest of the world.","words":[{"text":"Now","start":0.0,"end":0.7,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":0.78,"end":0.96},{"text":"know","start":0.96,"end":1.16},{"text":"many","start":1.16,"end":1.36},{"text":"people","start":1.36,"end":1.62},{"text":"in","start":1.62,"end":1.82},{"text":"this","start":1.82,"end":1.96},{"text":"room","start":1.96,"end":2.3},{"text":"and","start":2.3,"end":2.58},{"text":"around","start":2.58,"end":2.86},{"text":"the","start":2.86,"end":3.04},{"text":"world","start":3.04,"end":3.44},{"text":"will","start":3.44,"end":4.0},{"text":"think","start":4.0,"end":4.34,"punct":","},{"text":"well","start":4.74,"end":4.82,"punct":","},{"text":"actually","start":4.82,"end":5.38,"punct":","},{"text":"this","start":5.64,"end":5.84},{"text":"is","start":5.84,"end":6.0},{"text":"hard","start":6.0,"end":6.28},{"text":"to","start":6.28,"end":6.5},{"text":"grasp","start":6.5,"end":6.94,"punct":","},{"text":"because","start":7.22,"end":7.96},{"text":"private","start":7.96,"end":8.7},{"text":"capitalism","start":8.7,"end":9.22},{"text":"and","start":9.22,"end":9.76},{"text":"liberal","start":9.76,"end"